# Vulnerability details

## Impact

Users can spend as much of their voltage as they want with `spendVoltage()`. If a user realizes they are going to lose a match (or for any reason, it can be entirely arbitrary), they can spend all of their voltage, forcing `updateBattleRecord` to revert when the game server calls it due to the `_voltageManagerInstance.ownerVoltage(fighterOwner) >= VOLTAGE_COST` require statement not being met. Thus, the user can avoid the risk of losing their stakes by unstaking before the game server calls `updateBattleRecord` again. Or, if the user realizes they are winning, they can perform the same actions to increase their stake.


