## Impact
Non Transferable game item can be transferred by using safeBatchTransferFrom() of ERC1155.


## Proof of Concept
When a game item is created, it has different attributes. One of them is ``transferable``. It denotes whether or not a minted game item is transferable to other address or not. 

To ensure non-transferable game items can't be transferred to another address, there is a safeguard mechanism for ``safeTransferFrom()``.
```solidity
