# Vulnerability details

## Description
When fighting battles points are counted towards a raffle of a merged fighter. These winners are picked off-chain by the protocol and then published on-chain using `MergingPool::pickWinner`.

At a later time, the winner can call `MergingPool::claimRewards` to mint any won fighters. This will loop through all the unclaimed rounds and call the `FighterFarm` contract to mint an nft for each round they won in.

The issue is that there is a reentrancy attack using `_safeMint` possible if the winner also has won later rounds.

