## Proof of Concept

Contract overrides `transferFrom` and`safeTransferFrom(address, address, uint)` function and adds check that reverts execution if NFT staked. But `safeTransferFrom(address, address, uint, bytes)` is not overriden and hence can be used to freely transfer fighter.

