Deploy FighterOps Library: Deploy the FighterOps library contract.

Trigger Reentrancy Attack: Call a function in the FighterOps library contract that allows external contract calls. Within this function, initiate a reentrancy attack by calling back into the same function or another vulnerable function before completing the current execution.

