## Description
Game items added to the game have the [transferable](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-02-ai-arena/blob/main/src/GameItems.sol#L38) field, which indicates whether an owner of such item can transfer the given item. This is enforced in the [safeTransferFrom function](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-02-ai-arena/blob/main/src/GameItems.sol#L291), where the function checks if the item can be transferred and reverts if it can not. However, this can be circumvented by using the other function of ERC-1155, `safeBatchTransferFrom`.

