## Impact
In the ``RankedBattle.sol`` contract when a user call the ``stakeNRN()`` function his NFT gets locked in the ``FighterFarm.sol`` contract for the duration the user is staking some NRN in the ``RankedBattle.sol`` contract. When an NFT is locked it shouldn't be transferable, but the protocol doesn't take into account that the ERC721 implementation provides two ``safeTransferFrom()`` functions, as one of them takes an additional data parameter which results in a different function signature, thus a locked NFT can still be transferred utilizing the 
```solidity
    function safeTransferFrom(
        address from,
        address to,
        uint256 tokenId,
        bytes memory data
    )
```
