## Impact
In the case of `claimFighters` and `redeemMintPass`, an internal call is made to `_createFighterBase` to generate the element, weight, dna. However, the element calculation is `dna % numElements[generation[fighterType]]`. The numElements mapping has only the first entry set, with no way to update future generations. Therefore for any generation after 0, this calculation will be dna % 0, which will always revert.

As a result, any users who may have spent resources to gain a mint pass or claim will not be able to redeem for an nft after gen 0. These nfts are systematically compromised due to this error. 

